From 093a8e86ac2734330bf07c1a2724b6f0ec884475 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:24:10 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fix API gate, /my-forms, XSS, OAuth state and privacy issues
 from audit

Backend
- Move the request gate out of routes/api.php (a file-level `return` only
  stopped route loading and answered 404) into SecurityGate middleware.
  Origin check is now an exact match (was a prefix check that accepted
  https://wikiforms.toolforge.org.evil.example); stale created_at column
  reference fixed; generic client UAs (curl, python-requests, ...) no longer
  blocked.
- Rewrite /my-forms: filter in SQL, select only light columns, batch the
  response counts instead of 2 queries per form (memory/time crashes);
  no double urldecode of the username.
- Verify the OAuth `state`; stop reading/storing/returning users' email
  (privacy page promises none); hash long-lived auth tokens at rest;
  escape the JSON embedded in the login popup script.
- save-form: owner comes from the session only; created_at kept on update.
- translations: others' live translations cannot be overwritten; validate
  language codes; throttle write endpoints and /usr-lang.
- Heartbeat gets its own throttle (3s interval used the whole 20/min limit).
- Accept both env var naming styles; fix APP_URL typo default.
- Add guarded migration for tables/columns that only existed in init.sql.

Frontend
- Sanitize question text/feedback HTML (allowlist) at every
  dangerouslySetInnerHTML sink; only https cover images.

Repo hygiene
- Add .gitignore; remove api.php.bak and Footer.jsx.save; fix invalid
  toolinfo.json, broken Hall of Fame link, license line in humans.txt;
  deploy scripts stop on first error.

